        Paragraph(Text("For arbitrary n and the original coefficient field, the coefficient vector of ∏i(X-a i) is obtained by evaluating the universal multivariate polynomial Q_k=(∏i(X-C(X i))).coeff k at a. Pinned Polynomial.coeff_map, map_prod, map_sub, map_X, map_C and MvPolynomial.eval_X prove this equality coefficientwise. Pinned AnalyticOnNhd.eval_continuousLinearMap at the identity and AnalyticAt.pi give the forward analytic coefficient map for every NontriviallyNormedField 𝕜, any finite index type, any finite subset and any coefficient index; the Sym coefficient-chart application additionally assumes IsAlgClosed 𝕜. Over a commutative topological ring, the identical universal-polynomial formula and MvPolynomial.continuous_eval give its continuous form.")),
        Paragraph(Text("For symmetric polynomial substitution, pinned MvPolynomial.esymmAlgHom_fin_bijective supplies the polynomial in elementary symmetric coordinates. Rename, bind and aeval laws implement uniform substitution; the coefficient coordinates use the sign (-1)^(j+1) at the reversed index. Evaluating this representation and composing polynomial evaluation with continuous linear coordinates proves the analytic coefficient-to-coefficient map, over NontriviallyNormedField 𝕜 with IsAlgClosed 𝕜, for every q:𝕜[X] and every coefficient vector, including collisions.")),
